- id: request-required-property-became-not-read-only-in-openapi-31
  text: the request required property `id` became not read-only
  comment: In OpenAPI 3.1 and later, required applies to a read-only property in requests too, so clients already send it and this change cannot invalidate a request.
  level: 1
  operation: POST
  operationId: createOneGroup
  path: /api/v1.0/groups
